<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>公民权利</title>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #2c2c2c;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .page-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    background-color: #fff;
    /* Grid paper effect */
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(#e0e5ec 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, #e0e5ec 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 22px 22px;
    padding: 60px 50px 40px 50px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Spiral binding holes simulation */
  .page-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 15px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 20px;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #2c2c2c 7px, transparent 8px);
    background-size: 28px 20px;
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
  }

  .main-title-container {
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .main-title {
    color: #2a4b9b;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .col-left {
    width: 62%;
  }

  .col-right {
    width: 35%;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .section-title .num {
    color: #2a4b9b;
  }

  .q-text {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .mindmap-block {
    position: relative;
    margin-left: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .bracket-top {
    display: inline-block;
    border-top: 2px solid #333;
    border-left: 2px solid #333;
    border-right: 2px solid #333;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .list-item {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }

  .circled {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1.5px solid #333;
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 2px 12px;
  }

  .q-block {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .q-block .q-title {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .q-block .a-item {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .split-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .split-col > div {
    width: 48%;
  }

  .blue-ink {
    color: #2a4b9b;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-container">

  <!-- Main Title -->
  <div class="main-title-container">
    <div class="main-title">
      <!-- Top curved line -->
      <svg style="position: absolute; top: -15px; left: -10%; width: 120%; height: 20px;" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M 0 15 Q 50 0 100 15" fill="transparent" stroke="#2a4b9b" stroke-width="3" />
      </svg>
      公民权利
      <!-- Right swoosh arrow -->
      <svg style="position: absolute; right: -110px; top: 10px; width: 110px; height: 90px;" viewBox="0 0 110 90">
        <path d="M 10 10 Q 70 80 100 30" fill="transparent" stroke="#2a4b9b" stroke-width="3.5" />
        <polygon points="100,30 90,25 95,40" fill="#2a4b9b" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-wrapper">

    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col-left">
      <div class="section-title"><span class="num">①</span> 公民基本权利</div>

      <div class="q-text">
        <span class="blue-ink" style="display:inline-block; transform: rotate(45deg); margin-right: 5px;">↘</span> Q: 有哪些
      </div>

      <div class="mindmap-block">
        <div class="bracket-top" style="margin-top: 70px;">
          政治权利, 
          <span style="position: relative;">
            人身自由, 
            <!-- Annotation above 人身自由 -->
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 130%; left: 10px; width: 300px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; white-space: nowrap;">
              <div><span class="blue-ink" style="display:inline-block; transform: rotate(45deg); margin-right: 5px;">↗</span> 人格尊严不受侵犯</div>
              <div style="margin-left: 30px;">人身自由不受侵犯, 住宅不受侵犯</div>
              <div style="margin-left: 30px;">通信自由, 通信秘密</div>
            </div>
          </span>
          <span style="position: relative;">
            经济权, 
            <!-- Annotation below 经济权 -->
            <div style="position: absolute; top: 110%; left: 0; width: 220px; font-size: 15px; white-space: nowrap;">
              <div class="blue-ink" style="margin-left: 25px;">↓</div>
              <div>财产权, 劳动权, 物质帮助权</div>
            </div>
          </span>
          受教育权, 文化权利
        </div>

        <div class="list-item" style="margin-top: 60px;">
          <span class="blue-ink" style="font-size: 22px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;">(</span>平等权, 宗教信仰自由, 
          <span style="position: relative;">
            特定人群的特殊保障
            <!-- Annotation right of 特定人群的特殊保障 -->
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -20px; left: 102%; width: 260px; font-size: 15px; white-space: nowrap;">
              <span class="blue-ink" style="display:inline-block; transform: rotate(45deg); margin-right: 5px;">↘</span> 名誉, 荣誉, 肖像, 姓名, 隐私权
            </div>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="list-item">
          选举权, 被选举权, 政治自由
        </div>

        <div class="list-item">
          <span class="circled">监督权</span>
        </div>

        <div class="blue-ink" style="margin-left: 35px; margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          ↓
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-block">
        <div class="q-title">Q: 内容, 意义, 注意事项</div>
        <div class="a-item">① 批评, 建议, 申诉, 控告, 检举</div>
        <div class="a-item">② 有利于国家依法行使权利, 全心全意为人民服务</div>
        <div class="a-item">③ 不得捏造, 歪曲事实</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-block">
        <div class="q-title">Q: 人身自由内容, 意义</div>
        <div class="a-item">① 如上</div>
        <div class="a-item">② 有利于公民独立, 自由, 有尊严地生活</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-block">
        <div class="q-title">Q: 人身自由侵权表现</div>
        <div class="a-item">非法拘禁和以其他方法非法剥夺, 限制公民人身自由,</div>
        <div class="a-item">非法搜查公民身体</div>
      </div>

      <div class="split-col">
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-title">Q: 人格尊严内容, 侵权表现</div>
          <div class="a-item">① 如上</div>
          <div class="a-item">② 用任何方式对公民进行侮辱, 诽谤, 诬告陷害</div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-title">Q: 侵犯住宅权表现</div>
          <div class="a-item">非法搜查或侵入公民住宅</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col-right">
      <div class="section-title"><span class="num">②</span> 依法行使权利</div>

      <div class="q-block">
        <div class="q-title">Q: 如何依法行使权利</div>
        <div class="a-item">① 不得损害国家, 社会, 集体的利益, 其他公民<br>的合法自由, 权利</div>
        <div class="a-item">② 树立按照法定程序办事意识</div>
        <div class="a-item">③ 维权方式维权</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-block" style="margin-left: 20px;">
        <div class="q-title">
          Q: <span class="blue-ink" style="display:inline-block; margin: 0 5px;">↓</span> 有哪些
        </div>
        <div class="a-item" style="margin-left: 0;">和解, 调解, 仲裁, 诉讼</div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
